## Endpoints

### Auth Flow (1)
- `POST /verify` — Authenticate with Oddschecker.

### Data Read (7)
- `GET /{id}/sodar` — Retrieve SODAR data for a specific ID.
- `GET /api/surveys/` — Get survey data from the API.
- `GET /chunks/j258vkpn4vj5l0f1g9uklxa/Anchor,Sticky2` — Fetch specific data chunks.
- `GET /fs/api/v2/font` — Retrieve font data.
- `GET /j.php` — Retrieve data from j.php endpoint.
- `GET /v2/embed/{embedId}` — Retrieve an embedded widget by ID.
- `POST /distributor/distributor.Distributor/GetWidgets` — Request widgets from the distributor.

### Data Write (3)
- `POST /api/v1/ingest` — Ingest data into the Oddschecker system.
- `POST /push/api/{apiId}` — Push data to a specific API endpoint.
- `POST /v2/widget` — Create or update a widget.

### Media (1)
- `GET /{id}/api/image/optimize` — Optimize an image by ID.

### Realtime (1)
- `POST /eu01/events/t/u` — Post event data to a realtime endpoint.

### Config (1)
- `POST /flags/` — Update feature flag configurations.

